		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4156&amp;p=34538#p34538"><![CDATA[
Lots of work going on in the background, the ability to change your callsign prefix (YOU WILL HAVE TO APPLY FOR A ID NUMBER FOR EACH COUNTRY) when traveling between the different countries within the UK is working very well when using the Digital networks, the south west region of the UK has a network of 28 DMR Repeaters linked together, making the use of the Roaming facility within the OpenGD77 software a must activate.<br><br>A huge thanks to Roger and his team of Developers and Beta testers for all there work on this project.<br><br>Merry Xmas &amp; Happy New Year to one and all.<br><br>John<br>GW6RTV<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=3150">gw6rtv</a> — Tue Dec 10, 2024 12:50 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
